    {
      "subId": "7501112",
      "subQuestName": "与奇科娅对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750110301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750110301": {
            "id": "750110301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "没想到「浮土静界」的中心是一座被藏起来了的岛，哎，我就说为什么「浮土静界」和我在图里看到的不一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110302"
            ]
          },
          "750110302": {
            "id": "750110302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "这说明我的记忆还是可靠的，毕竟平时有在担当整理古代织物的工作嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110303"
            ]
          },
          "750110303": {
            "id": "750110303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，这里除了中间有个更大的石头以外，就没有其他的东西了…难道这个大石头就是「盗火贤者」的馈赠了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110304"
            ]
          },
          "750110304": {
            "id": "750110304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110305"
            ]
          },
          "750110305": {
            "id": "750110305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "…到这里，就，姐姐我也不知道啦。因为所有的织卷里都画着，勇士们经过试炼达到这里，就能够感受到「盗火贤者」的精神。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110306"
            ]
          },
          "750110306": {
            "id": "750110306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "只要是通过试炼来到此处的人，就能够感受到一种召唤。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110307"
            ]
          },
          "750110307": {
            "id": "750110307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "但是具体是什么形式，我也不知道。本来我以为到了这里以后我就能知道，就能够…可是现在看来并不行呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110308"
            ]
          },
          "750110308": {
            "id": "750110308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯…呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110309"
            ]
          },
          "750110309": {
            "id": "750110309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#咦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}你能看到吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110310"
            ]
          },
          "750110310": {
            "id": "750110310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110311"
            ]
          },
          "750110311": {
            "id": "750110311",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那，你能看懂吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110312"
            ]
          },
          "750110312": {
            "id": "750110312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110313"
            ]
          },
          "750110313": {
            "id": "750110313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "#你…看到了？你有看到什么吗？没有想到，原来有资格得到馈赠的人是{NICKNAME}{M#少年}{F#少女}吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110314"
            ]
          },
          "750110314": {
            "id": "750110314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦，我也什么都没有看到…真奇怪。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110315"
            ]
          },
          "750110315": {
            "id": "750110315",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我看到了金色的花纹…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110316"
            ]
          },
          "750110316": {
            "id": "750110316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110317"
            ]
          },
          "750110317": {
            "id": "750110317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#金色的花纹？你是说，在初次遇见{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}的地方看到过的那个吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110318"
            ]
          },
          "750110318": {
            "id": "750110318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸，那个不是你的幻觉吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110319"
            ]
          },
          "750110319": {
            "id": "750110319",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110320"
            ]
          },
          "750110320": {
            "id": "750110320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#就算{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}你示意我抬头也没用啦，我看不到，可是既然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}这样说了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110323"
            ]
          },
          "750110323": {
            "id": "750110323",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以当时留下金色花纹的，或许就是「盗火贤者」？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110324"
            ]
          },
          "750110324": {
            "id": "750110324",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "什么呀，原来你们之前就已经得到过「盗火贤者」的启示了啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110325"
            ]
          },
          "750110325": {
            "id": "750110325",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "奇科娅",
            "text": "#那前途无量的{M#少年}{F#少女}，哼，果然前途无量，毕竟能够被我看中嘛，那么{M#少年}{F#少女}有找到馈赠的方法吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750110326"
            ]
          },
          "750110326": {
            "id": "750110326",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
